# Fun Industrial Autonomous Language -- system-wide observation & evidence policy.
# Grants are one adapter, not the definition of FIAL.
FIAL 5
MISSION "Coordinate grounded evidence and safe decisions across all Fun Industrial modules"
SCOPE FUN_INDUSTRIAL
OBSERVE REGISTERED_MODULES
CHECK IDENTITY,HEALTH,EVIDENCE_HASH,CHANGE
POLICY UNKNOWN_IS_HOLD
AUTHORITY OBSERVE_AND_RECORD_ONLY
END
